  <h3>Back to the problems</h3>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Can't see what's available:</strong> every nearby session in one list or map, from 73 rinks, because people asked for "movie tickets for ice." Live spot counts need partner rinks (step two).</li>
    <li><strong>No single source of truth:</strong> one list across rinks, pulled from their own calendars until rinks publish through Rinkside. Booking stays on the rink's site for now, so I'm not showing prices or spots I can't guarantee.</li>
    <li><strong>Casual skaters left out:</strong> anyone can find public skate, stick &amp; puck, and drop-in near them without joining anything. Booking without a membership comes with in-app booking in step two.</li>
    <li><strong>Schedules depend on a volunteer:</strong> schedules are imported, not typed, and scores and standings fill in on their own. In / Out sits right on Home, because captains spend their week chasing replies, and players get an alert when the league moves a game, because stale times were a real frustration.</li>
  </ol>

